# mossbyte8 — original proportional pixel font in the 16-bit-RPG dialog
# tradition (7 px caps, 5 px x-height, 2 px descenders, single-px strokes,
# rounded corners). Every pixel in this file was authored by hand for this
# project; no existing font was traced, copied, or auto-converted.
#
# Palette planes: '#' ink, '+' shade, '@' accent, '.' transparent.

font mossbyte8
line_height 11
ascent 8
descent 2
tracking 0
fallback U+FFFD

glyph U+0020   # space
adv 3
empty

glyph U+0021   # !
adv 2
bearing 0 7
rows
#
#
#
#
#
.
#
end

